{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Paeton hands the captain a gold coin. \"You don't have change, by chance, do you? I'm afraid that I havent been able to get to the bank today.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:34:02.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863865739332419626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"If not, ill just pay the fare for your next passenger.\" Paeton takes a seat directly in front of Jigsaw. \"Hello, my friend. My name is Paeton. Please let me know if you need someone to hand you tools, or otherwise offer assistance while you work on the ship.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:41:12.842000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863867545970671626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
