{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"(ah I've already started rping in <#863315583080595476> but I'm waiting for a DM so I'll add what they would have said on the ferry while I wait) \n\nJigsaw turns from their work inspecting the engine and looks over Paeton through their thick glasses. You can't see their eyes through the lenses but you still very much feel watched. Their strange tail swishes and picks up their bag off of the ground next to them. \"Thank you for the offer but I think I have things covered... At least for now while I don't have all my tools.\" they look angrily at their mostly empty bag.","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:52:42.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863870437825052693","reply_to_id":"863867545970671626","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Paeton looks taken aback. \"Oh? What happened to your tools? Did you get pickpocketed? If you know who took them, or have any leads, I'd be glad to help you retrieve them.\" Paeton tries and fails to conceal the eagerness behind his eyes.","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:58:10.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863871816115814430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Evelyn steps off the ferry and heads to <#852737863170654259>","created_at":"2021-07-11T19:58:15.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863871836479291442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Jigsaw narrows their eyes... Or at least you imagine they would. \"No... The dirty coats took all of my tools along with my life's work.\" they say bitterly","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:01:01.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863872530317836289","reply_to_id":"863871816115814430","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Oh. That makes sense. Yeah. I was lucky to have been able to keep my alchemists tools as well as a shovel and an iron pot. I didnt own anything else, until today, when I won some prizes, here.\" Paeton pauses for a moment, not seeing an easy transition into what his original intent was, in starting this conversation. \"Say, maybe we could gather enough gold to get your tools back, if we started adventuring together?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:04:31.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863873411570204702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"At first they look taken aback by this idea, but after taking a long look at their empty bag and imagining the designs they keep inside with no way of building them, they turn back. \"... What kind of adventuring?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:12:46.463000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863875488392020008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Paeton can't hold back his pleased smile. \"Well, that would be up to us to decide. I personally like to take quests that benefit not only myself, but also society or the underdog. I came here to learn more about my powers, and help the helpless, in the meantime. What kind of quests would interest you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:15:12.430000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863876100621729812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"They frown slightly \"I need to rebuild my armor... To do that I need armor to modify... And to modify armor I need the right tools. Until then I'm not of much use. I can't even channel arcana into my designs without smiths tools as my focus.\" They think for a moment \"and besides, I don't care much about adventures unless it is find parts for my inventions or to get back at those dirty coats\" they say the last part through gritted teeth.","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:23:04.980000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863878082640085043","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Hmm. I will do my best to find something that might reward us with parts, and something that will hurt the reds.\" Paeton ponders this for a moment, before asking, \"Do you live on one of the airships in Kingsbridge? I'm on The Siren's Song. I could drop by once I find something for us to do? I'll keep an eye out for some other party members, also.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:27:13.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863879125348777985","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Apgan arrives in Ferrytown, having changed clothes in the bathroom on the ship. It will have to do as a disguise.","created_at":"2021-07-11T20:27:32.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863879203560620082","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
